    {
      "text": "serpent was more subtil than any beast, Gen. 3:1 (Moses 4:5). Dan shall be a serpent by the way, Gen. 49:17. it became a serpent; and Moses fled from before it, Ex. 4:3. Lord sent fiery serpents among the people, Num. 21:6 (Deut. 8:15; 1 Ne. 17:41). Lord said unto Moses, Make thee a fiery serpent, Num. 21:8. Moses made a serpent of brass, Num. 21:9. brake in pieces the brasen serpent, 2 Kgs. 18:4. his hand hath formed the crooked serpent, Job 26:13. They have sharpened their tongues like a serpent, Ps. 140:3. his fruit shall be a fiery flying serpent, Isa. 14:29 (2 Ne. 24:29). dust shall be the serpent’s meat, Isa. 65:25. I will send serpents, cockatrices, among you, Jer. 8:17. I command the serpent, and he shall bite them, Amos 9:3.",
